OL,3,ASwinney insists 'stars are aligning'
OL,4,Afor Scottish independence
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney will insist that "the
OL,7,Fstars are aligning" for Scottish
OL,8,Findependence during his keynote speech
OL,9,Fto the SNP conference later.
OL,11,FThe first minister is to tell party
OL,12,Fmembers in Aberdeen that 2026 has been
OL,13,Fa turning point in the country's
OL,14,F"journey towards statehood".
OL,16,FSwinney will stress that "in Edinburgh,
OL,17,FCardiff and Belfast, every first
OL,18,Fminister now supports our nations'
OL,19,Fright to self-determination".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
