OL,3,AMajor protest march held in Paris as
OL,4,Amore than 160 arrested across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 160 people have been arrested
OL,7,Facross France, with tens of thousands
OL,8,Fexpected at protests against rising
OL,9,Ffuel prices and the cost of living
OL,11,FA major demonstration is under way in
OL,12,FParis - you can watch live above
OL,14,FThe French interior ministry condemns
OL,15,Fwhat it calls "targeted acts of
OL,16,Fviolence" and accuses some protesters
OL,17,Fof attempts at looting and attacks on
OL,18,Fpolice
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
