OL,3,AMajor protest march held in Paris as
OL,4,Amore than 160 arrested across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the ground, a group of young people
OL,7,Ftells our correspondent they are
OL,8,F"pacifists" who are "just trying to
OL,9,Fmake things change"
OL,11,FToday's demonstrations come after three
OL,12,Fweeks of student protests across the
OL,13,Fcountry, with calls for students to be
OL,14,Fjoined by workers' unions and key
OL,15,Ffigures from the so-called "yellow
OL,16,Fvest" movement
OL,18,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,19,Fappealed for "calm", calling on
OL,20,Fdemonstrators to show "respect for
OL,21,Fpeople and property"
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
